    },
    {
      "name": "Font Awesome Free",
      "reason": "Not needed to reach the catalog size. Brand marks would also overlap Simple Icons. CC BY 4.0 would have allowed use with attribution."
    },
    {
      "name": "Material Symbols and Material Design Icons",
      "reason": "Apache 2.0 would allow redistribution. They were left out so the catalog would not double up thousands of the same concepts already covered, and because Material Symbols are weight variants of one glyph."
